# 默认：文本文件统一用 LF，检出时由 git 自行决定（Windows 上仍是 LF，避免 CRLF 污染 diff）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary

# 明确指定为二进制，避免被当作文本处理损坏
*.ico binary
*.icns binary

# Windows 批处理需要 CRLF 才能正常运行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# shell 脚本保持 LF
*.sh text eol=lf

# 锁文件：不参与 diff 统计，减少噪音
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true
